{{ill|Takiribime|ja|タキリビメ|simple|User:Immanuelle/Takiribime|en:draft||fr}} is described as marrying [[Ōkuninushi|Ōkuninushi]] which links them in with the {{ill|Izumo clan|en|4=simple|5=User:Immanuelle/Izumo clan}} in myth.<ref name="國學院大學デジタルミュージアム" /><ref name=":0" />{{rp|151-153}}

